  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Bring a large saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Slice onion (see ingredients) into thick wedges.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 18-20 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the veggiesbetween two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-2c69cb4f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, cook penne in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until ‘al dente’, 12 minutes. Reserve some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people), then drain the pasta and return it to the pan. TIP: ‘Al dente’ pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-5ba4f647.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, finely chop garlic.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-60e24d28.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, the butter and some pasta water (1/3 cup for 2 people / 2/3 cup for 4 people), stirring to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-24711992.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add vegetable stock pot to the sauce and stir to combine. Reduce heat to medium and simmer until thickened, 2-4 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then stir in the roasted veggies, red pesto, baby spinach leaves and cooked penne. Season to taste. TIP: Add another splash of reserved pasta water if the sauce is too thick.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-b4296751.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roasted veggie penne between bowls.\n• Crumble with marinated goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f84f3760389278541138d-ba577ffe.jpeg"
    }
  ]
